WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.084 --> 00:00:03.044
So, what brings
you two to Akumal?

00:00:03.586 --> 00:00:05.046
Vacation
from the kids?

00:00:05.046 --> 00:00:05.797
Oh, no kids.

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:06.589
That ship has sailed.

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.758
It's our ten year
anniversary.

00:00:08.758 --> 00:00:11.261
Take these, as they
will get you

00:00:11.261 --> 00:00:12.137
everything you need.

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:13.179
Even heroin?

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:13.763
Sorry?

00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:14.472
She's joking.

00:00:14.472 --> 00:00:15.265
That was a bad joke.

00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:17.976
I'm starting to
forget who I am.

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:22.022
No work, no stress,
no regrets.

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:24.190
Why don't we just see
where this leads us?

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:37.996
This phone belonged
to a kid who went

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:39.581
missing down here
fifteen years ago.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.252
It belonged to
Sam Lawford.

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:47.630
Sam, and his mom,
and his dad

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:49.049
and his girlfriend arrived
at this resort

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:49.716
on Christmas night.

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.427
But then, the
next morning,

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:53.178
he's gone.

00:00:55.346 --> 00:00:56.848
Later on, this other
guest from the resort

00:00:57.265 --> 00:00:59.100
was also
reported missing.

00:01:00.977 --> 00:01:02.228
Do you want to
get out of here?

00:01:02.771 --> 00:01:04.939
My daughter wanted
to spend Christmas here.

00:01:05.648 --> 00:01:07.358
But she didn't want
to spend it with me.

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:13.156
We found the
boy's skateboard.

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:18.119
Do you ever feel like something from the past

00:01:18.119 --> 00:01:19.496
is missing from your future?

00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:23.583
I'm gonna get
some answers.

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:26.252
Hey, come back here!

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.380
But what if there
aren't any answers?

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:34.886
Well, there have to be,

00:01:35.136 --> 00:01:37.013
because otherwise what
is the fucking point?

